90mb|n|A prop or support; a piece of timber in the form of a stake or post, used for a support or stay. ; Any upright post or beam used as a support, as for the deck, the quarter rails, awnings, etc. ; A vertical bar for confining cattle in a stall.	a:8crs,103,1;5w3j,46,1;56a7,36,5;8296,27,5~8296,27,5;56a7,36,5;5w3j,46,1;8crs,103,1	v:8crs,126,5;33z2,83,6;56a7,23,2~33z2,83,6;8crs,126,5;56a7,23,2	V:9w8z,80,1~9w8z,80,1	n:3ey2,94,11;3urk,59,3~3ey2,94,11;3urk,59,3	N:9w8z,106,6;11kj,98,6;9w86,79,3;2eu6,76,3;8hz6,25,4~11kj,98,6;9w8z,106,6;8hz6,25,4;2eu6,76,3;9w86,79,3
